## v0.8.1 – DNS Migration to Route 53 & Apex Domain Fix
**Date:** December 27, 2025 6:30 PM PST

### Changes Made:
- Migrated DNS from Namecheap to AWS Route 53
- Transferred domain registration from Namecheap to AWS
- Created Route 53 hosted zone with all DNS records:
  - A records (alias to ALB) for apex and www
  - MX records for Google Workspace email
  - TXT records for SPF, DKIM, domain verification
  - CNAME records for Resend email sending
- Set up ALB redirect rule: www.astrotask.io → astrotask.io
- Apex domain (astrotask.io) now works with HTTPS
- Users no longer need to type "www" to access the site

